<title>UK: Railtrack appoints commercial director.</title>
<headline>Railtrack appoints commercial director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British rail network operator Railtrack Group Plc said on Wednesday it would appoint Richard Middleton to its board in the executive position of commercial director.</p>
<p>The company said it will announce his joining date later.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
